/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:181:- Grid divided into four quadrants by a full-row and full-column divider of a single non-bg color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:182:- Each quadrant contains a red (2) square anchor block of varying size.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:183:- The top-left quadrant also has a colored motif attached to its red anchor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:186:- Use the top-left quadrant's motif as the source pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:187:- For each other quadrant, scale the motif by the ratio of that quadrant's red block size to the source red block size.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:188:- Reflect horizontally for right-side quadrants, vertically for bottom quadrants (both for bottom-right).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/4/044/codegen_prompts/6.md:191:Key insight: Red block size encodes the scale factor; quadrant position encodes the reflection axes.
