/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:268:Replicate a motif across quadrants with scaling and reflection keyed to red anchor blocks.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:271:- Grid divided into four quadrants by a full-row and full-column divider of a single non-bg color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:272:- Each quadrant contains a red (2) square anchor block of varying size.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:273:- The top-left quadrant also has a colored motif attached to its red anchor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:276:- Use the top-left quadrant's motif as the source pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:277:- For each other quadrant, scale the motif by the ratio of that quadrant's red block size to the source red block size.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:278:- Reflect horizontally for right-side quadrants, vertically for bottom quadrants (both for bottom-right).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:281:Key insight: Red block size encodes the scale factor; quadrant position encodes the reflection axes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/5/010/codegen_prompts/5.md:285:  "summary": "Copy the pattern adjacent to the red anchor block in the top-left quadrant to other quadrants, scaling and reflecting based on the relative size and position of matching red anchor blocks.",
